                                    <h1>Best D2C Marketing Agency for Home &amp; D&eacute;cor Brands India 2026 &mdash; AR Visualisation, Pinterest &amp; EMI Strategy</h1>

                                    <p><strong>Short answer:</strong> For D2C home + d&eacute;cor brands in 2026, the right agency leads with <strong>AR / 3D visualisation on PDP</strong> (Mirrar, Cylindo, Avataar &mdash; drives 1.5&times;&ndash;2.5&times; conversion lift), <strong>Pinterest + Instagram inspiration engines</strong> (Pinterest drives 35&ndash;55% of category discovery), <strong>EMI/BNPL prominent on cart + PDP</strong> (uptake 40&ndash;60% on orders &gt;&#8377;15K), and <strong>WhatsApp design-consult flows</strong> (drive 18&ndash;28% of revenue for premium brands). Retainers <strong>&#8377;1.5L&ndash;&#8377;6L/month + ad spend</strong>, blended ROAS <strong>4&times;&ndash;7&times;</strong>. Biggest red flag: no AR / 3D integration on PDP.</p>
                                    <p>This is the picking guide we give D2C home + d&eacute;cor founders evaluating marketing agencies in 2026. We&rsquo;ve scaled D2C furniture, lighting, kitchenware, home textile and art brands &mdash; with AR/3D viewers, Pinterest engines, EMI/BNPL, and WhatsApp design-consult flows at the core. No generic D2C advice. Real ranges, 12 questions, four honest red flags.</p>

